1915:ETTh1 & last-4 & $0.935$ & $0.39$ & $\mathbf{0.547}$ {\scriptsize($-42\%$)} & $1.54$ \\
2027:$5{\times}$Attention-pool  & $0.779 \pm 0.026$ {\scriptsize($+13\%$)} & $0.685 \pm 0.054$ {\scriptsize($+20\%$)} & $0.264 \pm 0.006$ {\scriptsize($-9\%$)}  \\
